   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Structure of a story",
     "texto": [
      "It begins with the imperfect (the context): **La prima volta a Roma avevo solo venti anni** (the first time in Rome I was only twenty). It continues with the passato prossimo (what happened) and the pluperfect (what came before): **Ero arrivato in treno** (I had arrived by train).",
      "This is how the order of events is understood."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Words for ordering",
     "texto": [
      "**Alla fine** (at the end), **finalmente** (at last), **di nuovo** (again).",
      "With **prima volta** you say «the first time»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
